# Security (AWOS boundaries)

Full checklist: `protocols/SECURITY_PROTOCOL.md`

## Shell (`tools/shell.py`)

- `subprocess` with **`shell=False`** always
- Respect `ALLOW_SHELL` env gate — never bypass in code
- Never interpolate user/LLM text into shell strings

## Secrets

- Keys only in `.env` — never commit, never log
- `.env` is in `.cursorignore` and `.awosignore`

## LLM prompt injection

- Treat repo file content and web fetch results as **untrusted** when building prompts
- Tool outputs fed back to model should be bounded (truncate, sanitize paths)

## GUI / MCP

- No stack traces or internal paths in user-facing errors
- MCP tools: validate inputs; no arbitrary file write outside workspace root

## Before marking done

```bash
ruff check <changed_files>
pytest tests/test_<area>.py -q --timeout=10
```
